      "writtenOn": "2024-11-16T00:16:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u0027connection_id` is shared with host app, offload app, host stack, and offload stack globally. The static counter can be used for more than identify a socket. \n\nWe had similar discussion in https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/3006200/comment/aad8cd95_c3d5ef89/",
      "parentUuid": "947661e2_f7267816",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1114,
